{"title":"Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003eExperience the Premium Quality of the Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"457\" data-start=\"46\"\u003eCreate a grand and elegant holiday centerpiece with the Cypress Spruce artificial Christmas tree collection from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Inspired by the majestic White Spruce, the Cypress Spruce is thoughtfully designed with lush greenery, layered branches, and exceptional realism to capture the beauty of a freshly cut evergreen while offering the convenience and durability of a premium artificial Christmas tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"881\" data-start=\"459\"\u003eKnown for its rich evergreen tones and luxurious fullness, the Cypress Spruce features abundant branch tips and a beautifully balanced silhouette that creates impressive depth and dimension from every angle. Its refined realism and elevated craftsmanship make it one of our most premium and realistic artificial Christmas tree collections, perfect for creating a timeless and sophisticated holiday display year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1057\" data-start=\"883\"\u003eAvailable in both pre-lit and unlit options, the Cypress Spruce is ideal for those seeking a full, statement-making Christmas tree with a warm and polished holiday aesthetic.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhy choose the Cypress Spruce?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1374\" data-start=\"1095\"\u003eThe Cypress Spruce is designed for those who love the look of a lush, full artificial Christmas tree with elevated realism and timeless elegance. Its dense branch construction and layered greenery create a rich, symmetrical silhouette that feels grand and luxurious in any space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1376\"\u003eInspired by natural White Spruce trees, the Cypress Spruce combines realistic foliage with impressive fullness, making it an ideal choice for both simple styling and ornament heavy decorating. Its abundant greenery and refined branch structure create a warm and welcoming holiday presence that feels sophisticated without appearing overly rigid or artificial.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"1805\" data-start=\"1741\" data-section-id=\"1997meq\"\u003eIs the Cypress Spruce a realistic artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Cypress Spruce is designed with a full, lush silhouette that creates a luxurious and balanced holiday look. Its abundant branch tips and dense greenery provide exceptional fullness throughout the entire tree, making it especially beautiful for \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbon\" href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e, and layered holiday décor. The Cypress Spruce is ideal for larger living spaces, open floor plans, and homes looking to create a statement making holiday centerpiece with timeless elegance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2833\" data-start=\"2772\" data-section-id=\"1myw0oo\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Cypress Spruce?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Cypress Spruce pairs beautifully with traditional, elegant, and luxury-inspired holiday décor. Its rich green tones and full silhouette complement everything from classic red and gold ornaments to modern metallic accents and soft neutral palettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"3324\" data-start=\"3270\" data-section-id=\"1eobop2\"\u003eIs the Cypress Spruce available pre-lit and unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3459\" data-start=\"3326\"\u003eYes. The Cypress Spruce collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate a variety of decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3699\" data-start=\"3461\"\u003eOur pre-lit Cypress Spruce trees feature professionally installed lighting designed to provide a warm and elegant glow throughout the tree, while unlit options allow for complete customization with your preferred lights and holiday décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4108\" data-start=\"3701\"\u003ePre-lit models feature both warm white and multicolor lighting options that can be easily controlled using the included Carol's Christmas Conifers remote. Multiple lighting functions allow you to customize your display with steady and fading effects in both warm white and multicolor modes. Each remote also includes built-in timer and dimmer functions for added convenience throughout the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"4163\" data-start=\"4110\" data-section-id=\"2nroxy\"\u003eIs the Cypress Spruce easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4427\" data-start=\"4165\"\u003eYes. The Cypress Spruce is designed for convenient setup, easy shaping, and long-term durability. Its hinged branch construction allows the branches to naturally fall into place during assembly, helping create a full and realistic appearance with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4619\" data-start=\"4429\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand, complimentary setup gloves for comfortable branch shaping and fluffing, and a complimentary storage bag for convenient after-season storage and protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4806\" data-start=\"4621\"\u003eWhen the holiday season is over, the tree can be easily disassembled and stored in a cool, dry place to help preserve its shape and realistic foliage for years of continued holiday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4806\" data-start=\"4621\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the full Cypress Spruce collection to find a premium artificial Christmas tree designed to deliver luxurious fullness, exceptional realism, and timeless holiday beauty for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-cypress-spruce-tree-led","title":"6.5' Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the majestic White Spruce, the Cypress Spruce showcases lush, true-to-nature greenery and vibrant, rich color. Carefully designed for realism and ease, it brings the serene charm of a winter forest into your home for a truly festive season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ LED","offer_id":28642925936704,"sku":"CS-T6.5-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/CypressSpruce_f0f71604-0519-417b-98ce-d9abe379435a.png?v=1714667202"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-cypress-spruce-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the majestic White Spruce, the Cypress Spruce showcases lush, true-to-nature greenery and vibrant, rich color. Carefully designed for realism and ease, it brings the serene charm of a winter forest into your home for a truly festive season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642926035008,"sku":"CS-T7.5-U","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/CypressSunroomVertical.jpg?v=1718158662"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-cypress-spruce-tree-led","title":"7.5' Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree with 1450 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the majestic White Spruce, the Cypress Spruce showcases lush, true-to-nature greenery and vibrant, rich color. Carefully designed for realism and ease, it brings the serene charm of a winter forest into your home for a truly festive season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ LED","offer_id":28642926198848,"sku":"CS-T7.5-L",